{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdZ9Cqq1Tnv1mnMqgCuv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When Dartmouth announced Provost Santiago Schnell's resignation on Wednesday, President Sian Leah Beilock explained it in terms of what leaders owe the people they teach. In her written statement she said that as AI changes the environment, \"it is so critical that we model the transparency and human judgment that we expect from our students and scholars.\" She added that the departure was \"his decision.\"\n\nThe statement follows a faculty committee's finding that Schnell used AI to \"meaningfully alter his writing\" and \"was not forthcoming about his AI use.\" The review began after Semafor ran guest columns in major newspapers through an AI filter and his August Washington Post column on AI cheating was found to be entirely written by AI. Schnell said he used ChatGPT to \"refine a few arguments\" and that the column was based on his own thinking. The Dartmouth, the student paper, later reported high rates of AI use in his recent writing using an AI detector. The article does not say how reliable these detectors are, and Schnell referred questions to his attorneys, who had not responded to the AP.\n\nThe president's wording puts a particular weight on candor. The committee's two findings are listed together in the article, but her statement speaks about transparency and judgment, and it presents the standard as one that applies to students and administrators alike. The article leaves open what level of AI assistance in writing Dartmouth considers acceptable, so the case does not settle where that line sits. It does show that at least one university treated an administrator's undisclosed use as serious enough to bring the matter before faculty, at a time when colleges across the country are working out how teaching should change now that AI tools can complete more assignments."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1595,"cache_read_input_tokens":4422,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1595},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92b14bfc-b269-494b-a37d-3c81f9d46641","uuid":"6fd457e8-4f8b-4b77-933d-deb3489f2f97","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:32:55.004Z","request_id":"req_011CgdZ9CbgqBX9t6CuckeNg"}
